--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party government content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Recorded fixtures under tests/fixtures/ are responses captured from
government services. They are third-party content, and the publisher's own
terms travel with them. They are NOT covered by the CC0 grant above.

THIRD_PARTY_DATA.yml lists each source, its publisher, and where its terms
are published. Check that file before redistributing any fixture.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Incorporated code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party code is vendored into this repository. Dependencies are
declared in pyproject.toml and carry their own licenses.

Where an idea came from another project, it was re-implemented rather than
copied, and the source is named in a comment at the point of use.
